# v12-merlin: written by tools/cycles scenarios. Cycle table grid: holds at throttle 1.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
# The renderer reads cut RPM THROTTLE SECONDS as a hold with the ignition off. snarl does not read these files.
hold 600 1 5.3
sweep 600 750 1 0.25
hold 750 1 4.4
sweep 750 1000 1 0.25
hold 1000 1 3.4
sweep 1000 1250 1 0.25
hold 1250 1 2.9
sweep 1250 1500 1 0.25
hold 1500 1 2.5
sweep 1500 1750 1 0.25
hold 1750 1 2.2
sweep 1750 2000 1 0.25
hold 2000 1 2
sweep 2000 2250 1 0.25
hold 2250 1 1.8
sweep 2250 2500 1 0.25
hold 2500 1 1.7
sweep 2500 2750 1 0.25
hold 2750 1 1.6
sweep 2750 3000 1 0.25
hold 3000 1 1.5
